On Sat, Nov 2, 2013 at 5:13 PM, Jerzy Grzegorek
<jerzy.grzegorek@trzebnica.net> wrote:
> According to the documentation, chapter
> 6.2.8.2 How to add a package from github
> "
> [...]
> FOO_VERSION = tag or full commit ID
> FOO_SITE = http://github.com/<user>/<package>/tarball/$(FOO_VERSION)
> [...]
> - The tarball name generated by github matches the default one from
>   Buildroot (...),
>   so it is not necessary to specify it in the +.mk+ file.
> "
> This commit makes the appropriate changes.
>
> Signed-off-by: Jerzy Grzegorek <jerzy.grzegorek@trzebnica.net>
> ---
>  package/civetweb/civetweb.mk                     |    4 ++--
>  package/jquery-keyboard/jquery-keyboard.mk       |    4 ++--
